
export anchor Story_756666ec53f96963:
    userPrompt:
        \\\
        When a story is drafted, the drafter searches the project's spec for the elements that the story touches (requirements, behaviours, names, and sections) and cites them specifically in the story. A drafted story is never only a prompt written from the request alone. Where no spec element matches, the story says so instead of inventing one.
        \\\

    mode: combined

    model: opus
